  "description": "Schemio is a powerful .NET library designed to aggregate data from heterogeneous data stores using a schema-driven approach. It enables developers to hydrate complex object graphs by fetching data from multiple sources (SQL databases, Web APIs, NoSQL stores) using XPath and JSONPath schema mappings.",
